{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this detective deduction game, uncover information by interrogating locals. Use that information to deduce good from evil. Discover who is lying all while watching the clock, and maintaining your reputation. Put an end to the syndicate. Or get duped trying, like the rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f325054790ef077d6a9b47bafccb6ed7.avif?t=1769161137\" alt=\"EVIL SPREADS UNCHECKED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.poster.avif?t=1769161137\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.webm?t=1769161137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.mp4?t=1769161137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful syndicate is operating from the shadows and must be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find clues about the mysterious figure behind it all, you must first take down the syndicates four branch leaders, and extract what little information you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding them is not a simple task however, and will require you solving many cases while maintaining your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/9c84ddcebf4700a9f87b1a80de5f27f0.avif?t=1769161137\" alt=\"DON&#039;T GET DUPED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.poster.avif?t=1769161137\" width=1170 height=762 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.webm?t=1769161137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.mp4?t=1769161137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil members of the syndicate must be brought to justice.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case presents you with a board containing a selection of suspects from <strong>over 100 roles</strong> that you must investigate and learn from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all the information and tools at your finger tips to figure out who is lying, and who is evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, arresting good folk will ruin your reputation and eventually get you fired.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eda6806f9fca901b09923a26c9f95945.avif?t=1769161137\" alt=\"THE SYNDICATE WATCHES\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f12f19a3c938f5e0396e768d47f1d47c.poster.avif?t=1769161137\" width=796 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f12f19a3c938f5e0396e768d47f1d47c.webm?t=1769161137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f12f19a3c938f5e0396e768d47f1d47c.mp4?t=1769161137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get closer to catching a regions branch leader, they will apply more and more pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Case quirks are rule augmenting modifiers that change the way you play, and stack up as you get closer to the final confrontation of a region.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 50 case quirks</strong> out there, you'll need to choose carefully in order to survive the syndicates attempts to thwart your efforts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f07e365de811cd5423256d96ccd58377.avif?t=1769161137\" alt=\"END IT ONCE AND FOR ALL\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use clues gained from catching branch leaders to find the syndicate head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything balances on your decision. Your run will end here, one way or another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/05eded008627ea952670f603b0b34a19.avif?t=1769161137\" alt=\"ALTERNATIVE MODES\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play\u00a0<strong>Daily Challenges </strong>and\u00a0let the cases keep coming in <strong>Endless Mode,</strong>\u00a0plan the perfect crime in our Two Player mode<strong>\u00a0</strong>or figure out who is working for the syndicate in our Three player mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845070?t=1769161137","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845070?t=1769161137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/f2fb63e15dbe394b03d5c6919eb52add0a7e3051/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769161137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/f2fb63e15dbe394b03d5c6919eb52add0a7e3051/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769161137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4111760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this detective deduction game, uncover information by interrogating locals. Use that information to deduce good from evil. Discover who is lying all while watching the clock, and maintaining your reputation. Put an end to the syndicate. Or get duped trying, like the rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f325054790ef077d6a9b47bafccb6ed7.avif?t=1769161137\" alt=\"EVIL SPREADS UNCHECKED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://s